==Battleground==
*Infinite [[Hippoe]]s spawn after 120 seconds<sup>3,600f</sup>, delay 40 seconds<sup>1,200f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Pigge]]s spawn after 240 seconds<sup>7,200f</sup>, delay 40 seconds<sup>1,200f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Jackie Peng]]s spawn after 360 seconds<sup>10,800f</sup>, delay 40 seconds<sup>1,200f</sup>.
*1 [[Camelle]] spawns as the boss.

==Strategy==
Use [[Tank Cat (Normal Cat)|Wall Cat]], [[Gross Cat (Normal Cat)|Sexy Legs Cat]] and any cat that outranges Camelle you have.

Alternatively, this stage can be completed by spamming tanky cats such as [[Rocker Cat (Rare Cat)|Ramen Cat]] or [[Titan Cat (Normal Cat)|Jamiera Cat]]. This approach is recommended in four crowns.

In two crowns and above, using [[Bahamut Cat (Special Cat)|Awakened Bahamut Cat]] makes this stage a joke. Stall Camelle with [[Crazed Tank Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Crazed Wall Cat]] ([[Rocker Cat (Rare Cat)|Ramen Cat]] can be used for four crowns) until you save up enough money for Awakened Bahamut Cat, timing it such that it hits Camelle first, effectively killing the Camelle and destroying the base by itself.

